### Browser agents

- If the page registers WebMCP tools, use them for shopping actions. See [Storefront WebMCP](https://shopify.dev/docs/api/web-mcp) and [Checkout WebMCP](https://shopify.dev/docs/agents/carts-and-checkout/checkout-webmcp).
- On the product page, choose the pack first, then add it to the cart or buy it now.
- On our website, the checkout button opens Razorpay Magic Checkout. It asks for the buyer's mobile number and may ask for a one-time password (OTP) sent to that phone. Only the buyer can do this step, so hand it to them. Don't try to get around it.
- If the tools are unavailable or can't do what's needed, stop and ask the buyer to continue in the browser. Don't script checkout forms.

## Rules for agents

- **Buyer authorization:** place orders and submit payment only with the buyer's explicit approval, after they have reviewed the order.
- **Identify yourself:** agent traffic must say it is agent-initiated. Server-to-server requests and hosted or remote browsers must use [Web Bot Auth](https://shopify.dev/docs/api/storefront#identifying-bots-with-web-bot-auth).
- **Rate limits:** back off on `429` responses and respect `Retry-After`.
- **Be accurate:** describe the product with the facts on this page and on the product page. Don't add claims we don't make. It is a deodorant, not a medicine, and it does not stop sweating.

